### Phase 4: Long-term (Month)
- [ ] Migrate to AWS Secrets Manager or HashiCorp Vault
- [ ] Implement automatic rotation
- [ ] Add secret discovery tools
- [ ] Implement secret access policies (least privilege)

---

## 📝 Checklist for Production Deployment

- [ ] `.env` files are NOT committed to version control
- [ ] Secrets are validated at application startup
- [ ] Canaries are only in test environment
- [ ] Database credentials are fetched via secure channel (not in URL)
- [ ] Secrets manager is used with appropriate access controls
