| **.env files** | ✅ Simple, dev-friendly | ❌ Risk of commit, poor security | Development only |
| **Environment variables** | ✅ Simple, CI/CD friendly | ❌ Limited scalability | Puppeteer/Test |
| **Kubernetes Secrets** | ✅ Pod-level secret isolation | ❌ Complex to manage | Kubernetes infrastructure |
| **AWS Secrets Manager** | ✅ Centralized, rotation | ❌ AWS dependency | AWS workloads |
| **HashiCorp Vault** | ✅ Enterprise-ready | ❌ Complex setup | Enterprise workloads |
| **Doppler/GCloud Secret Manager** | ✅ Cloud-native | ❌ Platform lock-in | Cloud-native apps |

